        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: A Simple Plan novel, A Simple Plan film\n- People: Scott Smith, Sam Raimi, Bill Paxton, Billy Bob Thornton, Bridget Fonda\n- Topics: film adaptation, review commentary\n\nFacts:\n- Scott Smith wrote A Simple Plan as a thriller novel published in 1993.\n- A Simple Plan was adapted into a film released in 1998.\n- Sam Raimi directed the 1998 film adaptation A Simple Plan.\n- Bill Paxton, Billy Bob Thornton, and Bridget Fonda starred in the film A Simple Plan.\n- A Times review said the novel A Simple Plan was so dark that the film story was changed to soften the ending.",
